    <string name="pif_footer_body">1. Tap \"Fetch Pixel fingerprint\", choose a channel and select a device.\n2. If no devices are found, import a working PIF config from a trusted source. Config files are not provided; you must find one yourself.\n3. Recheck your Play Integrity status.\n\nDroidGuard and the Play Store are restarted automatically when the configuration changes. Loading an expired PIF config will cause strong integrity via TrickyStore to fail, even with a valid keybox.\n\nLeave \"Spoof keystore provider\" off while a keybox is in use, since it bypasses keybox attestation.</string>
